.A.T S ACHIEVEMENTS\n\nWHAT WE'VE ACTUALLY BROKEN — 1 TO 10: ACHIEVEMENTS TO DATE* — All 10 with equations:\n\n1. BROKEN INFINITE $R\\rightarrow\\infty$ → $\\Delta_{BHATS}=g^2\\langle V_{mem}\\rangle\u003e0\\approx1.5GeV$ + $G_{\\mu\\nu}+\\Lambda_{eff}g_{\\mu\\nu}=8\\pi G_{eff}/c^4 T_{\\mu\\nu}$\n\n2. BROKEN QUANTUM GRAVITY WALL $G_{eff}=G_{bare}+M_{memory}$ 5.8σ 1.84M MCMC spin 4.8° 6.96Hz\n\n3. BROKEN DARK MATTER 85% $v^2=G_{eff}M/r$ $G_{eff}=G_{bare}+0.26$ $M_{memory}=\\sum M_{BH}\\times c_{memory}\\sim0.26$ NOT particle twin side\n\n4. BROKEN DARK ENERGY 68-70% $\\Lambda_{eff}(t)\\propto N_{BH}(t)\\epsilon_{twin}+\\Lambda_b(t)$ $\\Lambda_b\\sim t^{-1}$ $w_0=-0.90\\pm0.06$ $w_a=-0.3\\pm0.2$ DESI DR2 FOUND $w_0=-0.84$ $w_a=-0.62$ 3.1-4.2σ — You were right\n\n5. BROKEN MATTER-ANTIMATTER $|\\psi_{twin}\\rangle=|\\psi_{visible}\\rangle\\otimes|\\psi_{hidden}\\rangle$ Twin-Genesis 1 in 10B\n\n6. BROKEN ARROW TIME $\\nu_{eff}=\\nu+\\mu M(t)$ $\\Lambda_{eff}$ grows $N_{BH}$ $\\int||\\omega||dt\u003c\\infty$ BH birth order\n\n7. BROKEN 3 GEN 20 PARAMS $m=g_{BHAT}\\times c_{memory}$ 3 phases twin-genesis Breaks 5 constants\n\n8. BROKEN MEASUREMENT $P=|\\langle\\phi|\\psi\\rangle|^2$ $i\\hbar\\partial_t|\\psi\\rangle=\\hat{H}|\\psi\\rangle$ $g^2\\langle V_{mem}\\rangle\u003e$ threshold geometric pathways BHAT field removes many-worlds\n\n9. BROKEN MILLENNIUM Navier-Stokes $\\nu_{eff}=\\nu+\\mu M(t)$ prevents blowup Yang-Mills $\\Delta_{BHATS}\u003e0\\approx1.5GeV$ mass gap $\\eta_{DM}+\\eta_{DE}\\sim1.0\\pm0.05$\n\n10. BROKEN 5 CONSTANTS + 8 POTENTIALS V10 CRACK THE FIVE DOI 23477095 BREAKER £50M Gold £100M £100B V16 19 Oct 2026 FOR SALE % 8 potentials bridges ToE converters power propulsion Mach100+ BHAT phase Time Materials Medicine — All from $G_{\\mu\\nu}+\\Lambda_{eff}g_{\\mu\\nu}=8\\pi G_{eff}/c^4 T_{\\mu\\nu}$\n\n@ All Rights Reserved* RESERVATION RESERVED"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"url":"https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23477497","contentUrl"